sequenceDiagram
    participant Model as Chat model
    participant Guard as Middleware
    participant Engine as BehaviorEngine
    participant Tool

    Model->>Guard: get_alarm(machine="ETCH-3")
    Guard->>Engine: process(tool_call)
    Engine-->>Guard: decision
    alt kind in block_on, or scope halted
        Guard-->>Model: error: [BehaviorWeave:stop] ...
        Note over Guard,Tool: the tool never runs
    else any other decision
        Guard->>Tool: run
        Tool-->>Guard: result or failure
        Guard->>Engine: process(outcome)
        Engine-->>Guard: decision (blocking kinds halt)
        Guard-->>Model: result + guidance if actionable
    end
